abstract: >-
  Analysis code and non-restricted reproducibility materials for a study of the
  transportability of a cirrhosis mortality prediction model between health systems.
  The repository contains no patient data; MIMIC-IV, eICU-CRD and nwICU must be
  obtained independently under their own access agreements.
